A collaboration event between [[Nyanko Daisensou]] and the broadcasting and observation tower known as '''Tokyo Skytree''' (東京スカイツリー Tōkyō Sukaitsurī) was held from December 2nd, 2019 to December 26th, 2019. The collaboration includes an exclusive stage during the collab period.

==Event Information==
{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●7th anniversary collaboration！Between Jetstar & Tokyo Skytree & The Battle Cats!'''}}<br>
Let's all celebrate our 7th anniversaries!<br>
Holding a collaboration event between {{Color|#FF0000|'''"Jetstar"'''}} & {{Color|#FF0000|'''"Tokyo Skytree"'''}} & "The Battle Cats"!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Event period is scheduled from December 2nd, 2019 (11:00) to December 26th (10:59)!'''}}

{{Color|#00CCFF|'''・Collaboration stage "7 Years ★ Tokyo Skytree"'''}}<br>
Be excited for wonderful findings! "Tokyo Skytree" collaboration stage appears!<br>
During the event period, start at the title screen and go to Legend Stages, and after tapping the "Start!!" button, the limited collaboration stage "7 Years ★ Tokyo Skytree" will appear!<br>
By clearing the stage, there is a chance to obtain to event exclusive {{Color|#FF00CC|'''collaboration limited character "Sorakara"'''}}<br>
"Sorakara" has a higher chance of dropping in later stages!<br>
<small><small>※"Sorakara" is unlocked in the upgrade screen under Rare Cats.</small></small>

